adding:8px; min-width:80px; background:white; color:#1e293b;\"><b>Pulse Oximetry Reading (SpO<sub>2</sub>)</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccd8e0; padding:8px; min-width:80px; background:white; color:#1e293b;\">89% on 4 L/min nasal cannula</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccd8e0; padding:8px; min-width:80px; background:white; color:#1e293b;\">80% on 4 L/min nasal cannula</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccd8e0; padding:8px; min-width:80px; background:white; color:#1e293b;\"><b>Pain</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccd8e0; padding:8px; min-width:80px; background:white; color:#1e293b;\">5/10</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccd8e0; padding:8px; min-width:80px; background:white; color:#1e293b;\">10/10</td></tr></tbody></table>"
